        'They do not necessarily know their lineage is broken — usually the master will not say; and in the past it was not certain the master would teach you anything at all; teaching nothing was normal. Then as time changes, these nine disciples branch and scatter, repeating their own situation; it may become ever more lacking. However complete the origin, they scatter into nine who hold broken portions — while the one who received the complete lineage is complete, and the lineage-holders of every generation are complete. The rest are no different from those nine. Imagine then: countless years pass, countless generations, branching and scattering — cough. By here, the meaning should be clear to the clever; I will say no more.】',
        'Such beings may reach some stage, but there is no road onward — the road is cut. This is torment beyond question: they have attainment, they know cultivation is real, yet there is no further road; they can only watch themselves turn into a heap of yellow earth. Surely one of the most tormenting things of all.',
