        'Still, outer-seeking was born early in history, an initial form of things; but as reality changed, places meeting its requirements dwindled, and most cultivators turned to inner practice.',
        '【A complete outer-seeking method with full formulas is now a rare sight, rivaling extinction; the fragments that flow out now are just daoyin, qi-taking, standing-post and the like.】',
        '【Again: self-power and other-power】',
        'From the macro perspective of where qi comes from, there is again the distinction of self-power and other-power.',
        'To begin — the core in summary: basically there are only two differences: one, self-power; two, other-power.',
