        'Next, the rough content in detail.',
        'In fact the core is stated clearly enough in the summary above; digest it and the distinction is easy.',
        'At the macro essence: just those two points — one, the strength is yours; the other, the strength is not yours, but usable.',
        'Self-power methods',
        'A process of reaching the result through one’s own effort in practice, guided by the lineage — accepting no external power in the course: no seeding, empowerment, possession, overdraft, and the like.',
