        'In one phrase: such other-power beings are meat on the cutting board; when the other side wants to eat you, heaven help you.',
        'A tool in life, spare rations in death — that is what this describes.',
        'Question',
        'XXX: I only want to cultivate to become one of those immortals and gods~',
        'Answer: Very sorry — that kind is of the self-power kind; the strength is wholly their own. The self-power methods have since ancient times been hidden transmission, secret transmission, master seeking disciple, mouth to mouth — not even recorded in writing, not borne by outward things.',
        'Note: after thousands of years of evolution, what is on the market now is religion, or related to religion. True lineages have always been hidden transmission, secret transmission, master seeking disciple, never recorded in writing, never borne by outward things — hard for the outer world to know.',
