        'Divine Way methods#',
        'Divine Way methods are of two kinds: one is to gather the heart-thoughts of ten thousand people and cultivate oneself into a god or buddha; one is to spread religion, gain divine-way merit, and after death receive investiture as a divine official; one is to attach to a deity, patriarch-immortal or buddha and use one’s own spirit-qi or practice to swell the deity-seed, finally cultivating into a god-or-buddha emanation with some self-awareness.',
