        'With this question, first ask yourself honestly: where did your notion of reincarnation come from? Then go and look at how the idea of reincarnation was born, and you will understand whether such a thing as reincarnation exists.',
        'If you tell me “it has been said so since ancient times,” then I also know a saying: that the Son of Heaven who breaks the law is punished as a commoner — is that realistic? Possible? How many sayings are only sayings? If you cannot tell true words from false, do not resent being harvested.',
        'Once the matter of reincarnation is understood, the extremely related questions that follow resolve themselves naturally.',
