        'The other may be downstairs from your home, may be wandering homeless, may be amid the paper luxury of a KTV, may be chatting in a chuunibyou group, may be in some young lady’s arms, seven times a night — and so on and so on.',
        'Where the other is: necessarily where they wish to be.',
        'What? You want to meet a master?',
        'They are not a monkey, to be seen at will? You are far too wishful.',
