        'Ma 【if you don’t know how the character reads, search it yourself】: strengthens the heart; many wondrous uses for the heart region; also other effects — helpful for cough, pharyngitis, frozen shoulder, car-sickness with the sensation of the heart swaying and nauseous pain, and so on.',
