        'What fortune-telling gives is in fact a kind of high probability — say 70 percent. After you have had it told, your consciousness and subconscious are affected: you deliberately move toward it, or reverse-course against it, and in the end the chance of that probability coming to pass becomes 80 percent. A while later, calculate again — the next step unfolds on the basis of the 80 percent; step by step the probability accumulates, and in the end it simply calculates you to death. This is what “the more fate is calculated, the thinner it grows” means — because the thickness of your life is gone; the more you calculate, the more fixed it becomes.',
